{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1399282-about-time","id":1399282,"title":"About time","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-27T07:03:30-07:00","id":1399282,"title":"About time","content":"So about the time arcanum. <br /> <br /> so at what dot rating would i be able to &quot;summon&quot; a retainer. Say bob the mage need the help of a retainer, he is a time mage so he &quot;knew&quot; one all along, as i see the rules <br /> , at dot rating 3 we get to add merit dots. <br /> <br /> let say bobs is about to be beaten up by a gang in a ally, but with time 3 he had a bodyguard retainer with him all along. Is this doable? <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> also something unrelated, a normal spell is a ritual cast, (none extented action), but it is however a cast thats take longer where i get to add all the yantras i have, in a single cast, is that rigth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6707-exkramental","name":"Exkramental","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T08:11:54-07:00","id":1399289,"title":"","content":"I would say it's about the same level as Rewrite history (4 dots), and perhaps even Corridors of Time (5 dots). It's outright better than Golem (The Retainer is actually intelligent), but you probably have to pay the guy... so it's a bit iffy<br /> <br /> I would allow Weaving (3 dots) to add merits because most of the time a merit represents a trait or property the character has. Retainer is a merit that typically represents a social link, not something intrinsic to the character, so I wouldn't let you add it with just 3 dots.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11997-movingmind","name":"MovingMind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T09:34:06-07:00","id":1399305,"title":"","content":"My reasoning is a fate 2 spell (cant remember the name and dont hve my book here) that gives you help in a manner you need, and i seem to recall its via merits dots, i would have to check though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6707-exkramental","name":"Exkramental","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-27T22:33:21-07:00","id":1399512,"title":"","content":"The level at which it can be done depends greatly on where the Retainer comes from. If you have a bodyguard that was busy right then, using time to set things up so he appears is far easier than if you wanted to create one wholecloth, <i>Shifting Sands</i> suffices to give the guy time to show up with a couple Reach. <i>Rewrite History</i> works peachy to make certain life choices differently... temporarily.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-28T08:02:11-07:00","id":1399599,"title":"","content":"Hmm...yeah, I'd agree with Time 4 being to make a Retainer you hadn't already paid for with XP being manifested right the heck now in your hour of need, and Time 3 allowing you to adjust the timeline just enough that a Retainer you already had shows up at a convenient moment.<br /> <br /> This is one of those instances where, sure, the arcana can do it, but it can't necessarily do it at the same dot level. I'm pretty sure there's a sidebar about that in the spellcasting section.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T06:41:45-07:00","id":1399810,"title":"","content":"I will have a look for that side bar. Thanks.<br /> <br /> also on a side note. Normally its 5 dots in a arcana to outright delete or kill somebody, but with life 4, cant i just remove the blood vessels to the heart. Killing someone, i mean, that would be a lasting effect. Being dead and all. Or would you give a condition insted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6707-exkramental","name":"Exkramental","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T10:05:11-07:00","id":1399873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exkramental</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1399282-about-time?p=1399810#post1399810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will have a look for that side bar. Thanks.<br /> <br /> also on a side note. Normally its 5 dots in a arcana to outright delete or kill somebody, but with life 4, cant i just remove the blood vessels to the heart. Killing someone, i mean, that would be a lasting effect. Being dead and all. Or would you give a condition insted.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would probably represent a cardiac arrest as either of the Sick (Grave) or the Poisoned (Grave) tilts,with Life 3. (or both)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11997-movingmind","name":"MovingMind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-29T23:18:36-07:00","id":1400016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exkramental</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1399282-about-time?p=1399810#post1399810\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I will have a look for that side bar. Thanks.<br /> also on a side note. Normally its 5 dots in a arcana to outright delete or kill somebody, but with life 4, cant i just remove the blood vessels to the heart. Killing someone, i mean, that would be a lasting effect. Being dead and all. Or would you give a condition insted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Killing someone with less than 5 dots in an arcana is fairly trivial, yes. Killing someone with Unmaking is just more impressive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}